{"4847090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pools of the Deep VR", "steam_appid": 4847090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5060910], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/c9d4062aaee064354c25d4d81ef7156c.poster.avif?t=1788347899\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/c9d4062aaee064354c25d4d81ef7156c.webm?t=1788347899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/c9d4062aaee064354c25d4d81ef7156c.mp4?t=1788347899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pools of the Deep VR</strong> is an atmospheric exploration game set in vast, dreamlike pools and echoing corridors. Discover hidden puzzle pieces, collect coins, and descend deeper into surreal architecture filled with mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie, liminal environments: a collection of fractured dream-spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/2c988ac945bd3373ce61207460bb7519.poster.avif?t=1788347899\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/2c988ac945bd3373ce61207460bb7519.webm?t=1788347899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/2c988ac945bd3373ce61207460bb7519.mp4?t=1788347899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent archery combat: use your laser aim to get precise shots, move pieces and open doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/06a1dd71fd1d202d3c703265cc54c8cd.poster.avif?t=1788347899\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/06a1dd71fd1d202d3c703265cc54c8cd.webm?t=1788347899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/06a1dd71fd1d202d3c703265cc54c8cd.mp4?t=1788347899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/4efdbd8ebed47651c65878405a4ad53a.poster.avif?t=1788347899\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/4efdbd8ebed47651c65878405a4ad53a.webm?t=1788347899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/4efdbd8ebed47651c65878405a4ad53a.mp4?t=1788347899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find puzzle pieces and  coins: explore to unlock the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/f258bad725adbc7c7e83becbc1789dc7.poster.avif?t=1788347899\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847090/extras/f258bad725adbc7c7e83becbc1789dc7.webm?t=1788347899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto